    "detailed_description": "Cloak Hero is an action adventure dungeon crawler packed with classic roguelite elements. On the treacherous journey through the dark land, our hero has to be brave and strong, use different weapons, artifacts and magic spells to fight an army of evil monsters. With dangerous on every corner, gaining experience and learning new skills are vital to survival. Destiny awaits, could the Cloak Hero reach the deep of the dungeons?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is in development with Godot game engine by a solo game maker. All things are subject to change as the development progresses. Welcome to Wishlist the game, and thank you for your patient and support. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n* Randomly generated levels<br />\r\n* Different weapons and artifacts<br />\r\n* Powerful magic spells<br />\r\n* Mix of auto and manual combat system<br />\r\n* Upgradable Weapon Arts and Fabled Skills",
